From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 09:46:48 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 044/111] Compare two open tabs, and the two views
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

File and the tab's right-click menu get "Compare with", a submenu of the
other open editor tabs. It opens the compare tab "a.md ↔ b.md" with the
diff from this tab's text to the other's, unsaved text included; opening
it again refreshes and focuses it. With two views, "Compare the two views"
at the top of the submenu compares the tabs they show.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

